{{Headline|22|Competition Results}}


The competitions described in the [http://services.runescape.com/m=news/kebos-lowlands-progress-update?oldschool=1 Kebos Lowlands Progress Update] post drew to a close late last week. The Old School team would like to thank everybody who submitted an entry - we've been impressed by your creative talents and original art styles! Here's a list of all the winners and their entries. Winners will be contacted about their prizes in the coming days.

{{Headline|22|Kourend: The Story So Far Video}}

